          #StabilizingAndFixingTheQuaternions.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              The subgroups in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StabilizerOfQuaternions"}
              sit in a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} short exact sequence
              of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
